{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-the-haven","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"the-haven-meraki-majan","about":"The Haven is a luxury project by developer Meraki in Majan. The interiors of the residences are designed to create a harmonious and inspiring atmosphere, foster a connection with nature and support physical and emotional well-being.The Haven offers a range of modern amenities such as adult and children's swimming pools, several outdoor gyms, children's playgrounds, yoga studio, 24/7 security, co-working area and parking area.In the immediate vicinity are significant places of Dubai. Schools, hospitals and supermarkets are 10 minutes away, Dubai Hills Mall is 14 minutes away and the famous Palm Jumeirah Peninsula is 25 minutes away.The complex provides a warm and welcoming atmosphere and the apartments offer breathtaking views of the surrounding landscapes. At The Haven, everyone will find something to suit their health and wellbeing goals.","price":656135,"title":"The Haven","bitrix":{"id":540,"pf_id":"are.3.12975","source":null,"project_id":"Majan","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"The Haven","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Meraki","project_location":"Dubai Land"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/The_haven_at_majan_d245fa3082.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/The_haven_at_majan_d245fa3082.webp"}],"status":"ready","_geoloc":{"lat":25.0923595,"lng":55.3119308},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/The_haven_at_majan_d245fa3082.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/The_haven_at_majan_d245fa3082.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/The_haven_at_majan_d245fa3082.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/The_haven_at_majan_d245fa3082.webp"},{"340x252":"https:/